# SSH Brute Force
# Description: Groups failed SSH password attempts by source IP in 5-minute bins and alerts on bursts.
# ATT&CK: T1110 (Brute Force)
# Severity: Medium
# Schedule: Every 5 minutes, search window earliest=-10m latest=now
# Threshold: count >= 10 failed passwords from one src_ip in a 5-minute bin
# Known false positives: Patch or config automation with a stale credential; a user re-typing a password;
#   vulnerability scanners running authenticated checks.
# Index: tutorial

index=tutorial sourcetype=secure "Failed password"
| bin _time span=5m
| rex "from (?<src_ip>\d+\.\d+\.\d+\.\d+)"
| stats count by _time, src_ip
| where count >= 10
| sort -_time
